==Finnish==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|fiu-fin-pro|*südän}}, from {{inh|fi|urj-pro|*śüdäme}}. Cognate with {{cog|et|süda}}, {{cog|mns|сым|tr=sim}} and {{cog|hu|szív}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{fi-IPA}}
* ''Note:'' usually pronounced with a long ''m'' in inflections and derivations (e.g., sydämen [ˈsydæmːen]).

